WEBVTT

00:09.735 --> 00:11.070
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

00:11.070 --> 00:13.205
[mumbles]
[咕哝]

00:13.205 --> 00:14.740
[snoring]
[打鼾]

00:14.740 --> 00:16.742
- SQUIDWARD!
- AAH!
- 章鱼哥！
- 啊啊！

00:16.742 --> 00:18.077
WHAT IS YOUR PROBLEM?
您有什么问题？

00:18.077 --> 00:20.513
- MY PROBLEM IS THAT
YOU AREN'T WORKING,
- 我的问题是
你没有工作，

00:20.513 --> 00:23.716
WHICH MEANS I LOSE
M-U-N-E-E,
这意味着我输了
M-U-N-E-E，

00:23.716 --> 00:26.919
WHICH MEANS YOU LOSE
YOUR J-O-B.
这意味着你输了
你的工作。

00:26.919 --> 00:28.020
- REMIND ME AGAIN.
- 再次提醒我。

00:28.020 --> 00:30.122
IS THAT GOOD NEWS
OR BAD NEWS?
这是个好消息吗
还是坏消息？

00:30.122 --> 00:31.924
- TENTACLES, I MEAN IT.
- 触手，我是认真的。

00:31.924 --> 00:34.460
YOU GET BACK TO MINDIN'
THAT REGISTER.
你重新开始思考
那个注册。

00:34.460 --> 00:36.295
- MINDING IT
FOR WHICH CUSTOMER?
- 留意它
适合哪个客户？

00:36.295 --> 00:37.630
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

00:37.630 --> 00:38.764
- I SEE YOUR POINT.
- 我明白你的意思。

00:38.764 --> 00:40.165
BUT STILL,
I'M NOT PAYING YOU
但是，
我不会付钱给你

00:40.165 --> 00:42.101
TO DREAM SWEET NOTHINGS.
梦想甜蜜的事物。

00:42.101 --> 00:43.403
DO SOMETHING.
做点什么。

00:43.403 --> 00:45.237
PICK UP A MOP, A BROOM,
拿起拖把、扫帚，

00:45.237 --> 00:48.173
A WINDOW WIPER,
A SPATULA EVEN.
雨刷器，
甚至还有抹刀。

00:48.173 --> 00:50.309
- SPONGEBOB'S
GOT THAT COVERED.
- 海绵宝宝
明白了。

00:50.309 --> 00:55.515
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

00:58.884 --> 01:00.653
[gasps]
DUST SPECKS ON THE WINDOW!
[喘气]
窗户上有灰尘！

01:00.653 --> 01:03.188
DON'T WORRY, BOSS MAN,
I GOT IT COVERED.
别担心，老板，
我已经解决了。

01:03.188 --> 01:05.024
[squeegee squeaks]
[刮刀吱吱声]

01:05.024 --> 01:06.459
THAT'S BETTER.
这样更好。

01:06.459 --> 01:09.194
OOH, SOUNDS LIKE THE DISHES
ARE DONE SOAKING.
哦，听起来像菜肴
浸泡完毕。

01:11.897 --> 01:13.633
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:13.633 --> 01:16.469
- THAT'S A PERFECT EXAMPLE
OF WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT--
- 这是一个完美的例子
我正在谈论的事情——

01:16.469 --> 01:18.438
STAYIN' BUSY.
保持忙碌。

01:18.438 --> 01:21.106
- I WAS BUSY, TRYING TO FORGET
ABOUT THIS PLACE
- 我很忙，试图忘记
关于这个地方

01:21.106 --> 01:22.608
TILL YOU WOKE ME UP.
直到你叫醒我。

01:22.608 --> 01:25.144
- OKAY, HAVE IT YOUR WAY,
SQUIDWARD.
- 好吧，随你的便吧
章鱼哥。

01:25.144 --> 01:26.512
SINCE YOU CAN'T BE BOTHERED
既然你不会被打扰

01:26.512 --> 01:28.481
TO TAKE
THE INITIATIVE YOURSELF,
采取
你自己的主动性，

01:28.481 --> 01:31.784
IT'S CLEAR I MUST
ASSIGN TASKS TO YOU.
很明显我必须
为您分配任务。

01:31.784 --> 01:34.454
HM. MR. SQUIDWARD,
SCRUB THE WALLS
嗯。先生。章鱼哥，
擦洗墙壁

01:34.454 --> 01:37.557
OF THE KRUSTY KRAB
TILL THEY GLEAM.
甲壳蟹的
直到它们闪闪发光。

01:37.557 --> 01:40.493
- ALREADY DONE, SIR.
- 已经完成了，先生。

01:42.562 --> 01:44.029
- OH, WELL,
THAT'S VERY NICE, BOY.
- 哦，好吧，
这非常好，男孩。

01:44.029 --> 01:45.631
THANK YOU.
BUT, YOU SEE,
谢谢。
但是，你看，

01:45.631 --> 01:47.867
I'M TRYING TO GIVE SQUIDWARD
A TASK.
我想给章鱼哥
一项任务。

01:47.867 --> 01:51.136
- HM. WELL, THE SMOKE DUCT
NEEDS SWEEPING.
- 嗯。嗯，排烟管道
需要清扫。

01:51.136 --> 01:53.473
- EXCELLENT IDEA,
MR. SQUAREPANTS.
- 好主意，
先生。方裤。

01:53.473 --> 01:56.208
SQUIDWARD, I'D LIKE YOU
TO SWEEP--
章鱼哥，我喜欢你
扫地——

01:56.208 --> 01:58.511
[banging]
[砰砰]

01:58.511 --> 01:59.645
- DONE AND DUSTED.
- 完成并除尘。

01:59.645 --> 02:01.146
[wheezes]
[喘息声]

02:01.146 --> 02:04.817
- NICE WORKING CONDITIONS,
BUT NO THANKS.
- 良好的工作条件，
但不用了，谢谢。

02:04.817 --> 02:06.251
- OOH, IS THAT SO?
- 哦，是这样吗？

02:06.251 --> 02:08.187
PERHAPS YOU'D PREFER
SCRAPING THE GUM
也许你更喜欢
刮掉口香糖

02:08.187 --> 02:10.322
OFF THE UNDERSIDE
OF THESE TABLES.
远离底层
这些表。

02:10.322 --> 02:14.494
- OH, A RESTAURANT EMPLOYEE
HANDLING CHEWED BUBBLEGUM?
- 哦，餐厅员工
处理咀嚼过的泡泡糖？

02:14.494 --> 02:16.596
THAT'S GOTTA VIOLATE
A LOT OF HEALTH CODES.
这是必须违反的
很多健康码。

02:16.596 --> 02:20.065
- NOT IF YOU WEAR GLOVES,
IT DOESN'T.
- 如果你戴手套就不会，
事实并非如此。

02:20.065 --> 02:22.735
MIND IF I TAKE THIS TO PATRICK
AFTER WORK, MR. KRABS?
请介意我把这个带给帕特里克
下班后，先生。螃蟹？

02:22.735 --> 02:24.670
- I GUESS SPONGEBOB
HAS A HANDLE
- 我猜是海绵宝宝
有把手

02:24.670 --> 02:26.539
ON ALL THE KRUSTY KRAB DUTIES.
履行所有的蟹堡职责。

02:26.539 --> 02:30.409
WHICH LEAVES YOU WITH
ALL THE EXTRACURRICULARS--
这给你留下了
所有课外活动——

02:30.409 --> 02:32.912
LIKE SHINING ME SHOES.
就像给我擦鞋一样。

02:32.912 --> 02:34.947
- SORRY. ALL OUT OF POLISH.
- 对不起。全部都不是波兰语了。

02:34.947 --> 02:36.949
- BUT I'M NOT.
- 但我不是。

02:36.949 --> 02:41.521
- WASH ME BOAT!
- 给我洗船！

02:41.521 --> 02:44.423
- [singing]
- [唱歌]

02:46.425 --> 02:47.827
- LISTEN, SQUIDWARD.
- 听着，章鱼哥。

02:47.827 --> 02:49.629
I'M GONNA GET A FULL DAY'S WORK
OUT OF YOU,
我要完成一整天的工作
出于你，

02:49.629 --> 02:51.196
ONE WAY OR ANOTHER.
不管怎样。

02:51.196 --> 02:53.232
- IT DOESN'T MATTER WHAT
YOU WANT ME TO DO,
- 什么并不重要
你要我做的，

02:53.232 --> 02:54.600
I WON'T DO IT.
我不会这么做。

02:54.600 --> 02:55.901
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

02:55.901 --> 02:57.302
[chuckles]
OH, YEAH?
[笑声]
哦，是吗？

02:57.302 --> 02:58.337
FINE.
美好的。

02:58.337 --> 03:00.172
IF YOU REFUSE TO WORK,
如果您拒绝工作，

03:00.172 --> 03:02.808
THEN I CAN'T
BE HELD RESPONSIBLE.
那我不能
承担责任。

03:02.808 --> 03:05.545
- RESPONSIBLE FOR WHAT,
MR. KRABS?
- 负责什么，
先生。螃蟹？

03:05.545 --> 03:07.346
- FOR...
- 为了...

03:07.346 --> 03:09.649
FOR...
为了...

03:09.649 --> 03:15.555
A VISIT FROM THE YETI CRAB!
雪人蟹来访！

03:15.555 --> 03:17.322
- [gulp]
THE YETI CRAB?
- [吞咽]
雪人蟹？

03:17.322 --> 03:18.791
- YEAH.
- 是的。

03:18.791 --> 03:21.894
EVERYBODY'S HEARD
OF THE ABOMINABLE YETI CRAB--
每个人都听到了
可恶的雪人蟹——

03:21.894 --> 03:26.398
WITH HIS LONG WHITE HAIR
AND SIX-PACK ABS
留着长长的白发
和六块腹肌

03:26.398 --> 03:28.968
AND YELLOW TEETH.
还有黄牙。

03:28.968 --> 03:30.435
AND EVERYBODY KNOWS
THAT HE ONLY
众所周知
他只

03:30.435 --> 03:32.404
COMES OUT
OF HIS MOUNTAIN CAVE
出来了
他的山洞

03:32.404 --> 03:36.976
TO FEED ON LAZY WORKERS.
以懒惰的工人为食。

03:36.976 --> 03:39.178
HE'S ATTRACTED TO THE SCENT.
他被这种气味所吸引。

03:39.178 --> 03:42.715
HE CAN SMELL YOUR LAZY,
LAZY STENCH
他能闻到你的懒惰，
懒惰的恶臭

03:42.715 --> 03:45.417
FROM HUNDREDS OF MILES AWAY.
来自数百英里之外。

03:45.417 --> 03:46.586
- AAH! AAH! AAH!
- 啊啊！啊啊！啊啊！

03:46.586 --> 03:48.287
OH, WAIT.
WHAT AM I WORRIED ABOUT?
哦，等等。
我担心什么？

03:48.287 --> 03:50.856
I'M A HARDWORKING
SELF-MOTIVATED SPONGE.
我是一个勤奋的人
自我激励的海绵。

03:50.856 --> 03:53.092
- YES, BUT THAT WON'T
MAKE ANY DIFFERENCE.
- 是的，但那不会
做出任何改变。

03:53.092 --> 03:56.228
BECAUSE OF YOUR PROXIMITY
TO SQUIDWARD'S LAZINESS,
因为你的接近
由于章鱼哥的懒惰，

03:56.228 --> 03:59.231
YOU WILL BE EATEN.
- [gasps]
你会被吃掉的。
- [喘气]

03:59.231 --> 04:01.433
SQUIDWARD AND I ARE AS CLOSE
AS BROTHERS.
章鱼哥和我关系亲密
作为兄弟。

04:01.433 --> 04:02.434
- LUDICROUS.
- 可笑。

04:02.434 --> 04:03.703
- YOU WON'T THINK SO
- 你不会这么想

04:03.703 --> 04:06.872
WHEN THAT BIG HAIRY FELLER
WANTS TO EAT YA.
当那个大毛茸茸的家伙
想吃你。

04:06.872 --> 04:08.307
[chuckles]
[笑声]

04:08.307 --> 04:10.976
YEAH, NOW LISTEN UP, BOYS.
是的，现在听着，孩子们。

04:10.976 --> 04:13.478
BOSS MAN KRABS IS STEPPIN' OUT
FOR A MINUTE,
蟹老板即将退出
一分钟，

04:13.478 --> 04:15.648
BUT I WANT
THIS TUB OF LAUNDRY DONE
但我想要
这桶衣服洗完了

04:15.648 --> 04:17.016
BEFORE I GET BACK.
在我回来之前。

04:17.016 --> 04:18.450
OR--
或者 -

04:18.450 --> 04:20.953
- OR THE YETI CRAB WILL
SMELL OUR LAZINESS AND EAT US.
- 或者雪人蟹会
闻我们的懒惰并吃掉我们。

04:20.953 --> 04:22.221
- PRECISELY.
- 正是如此。

04:22.221 --> 04:23.956
SEE YA, BOYS.
再见，孩子们。

04:23.956 --> 04:25.124
- WHATEVER.
- 任何。

04:25.124 --> 04:26.892
- SQUIDWARD,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 章鱼哥，
你在做什么？

04:26.892 --> 04:29.528
[sniffs] OH, NO. YOUR LACK
OF WORK IS TAKING ON AN ODOR.
[嗅嗅]哦，不。你的缺乏
工作中散发出异味。

04:29.528 --> 04:31.731
- YOU'RE SURE IT'S NOT
THESE YOU'RE SMELLING?
- 你确定不是
你闻到的是这些吗？

04:31.731 --> 04:33.265
- IF THE YETI CRAB
CATCHES WIND OF IT,
- 如果雪人蟹
捕捉风声，

04:33.265 --> 04:37.169
HE'S GONNA, YOU KNOW,
EAT US.
你知道，他会，
吃我们。

04:37.169 --> 04:39.138
- OH, COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，来吧，海绵宝宝。

04:39.138 --> 04:42.775
KRABS'S YETI STORY
IS A COMPLETE AND TOTAL CROCK.
蟹蟹的雪人故事
是一个完整的陶罐。

04:42.775 --> 04:44.243
- [gasps]
SQUIDWARD!
- [喘气]
章鱼哥！

04:44.243 --> 04:46.545
MR. KRABS WOULD NEVER
MAKE UP SOMETHING LIKE THAT.
先生。蟹蟹永远不会
编出类似的东西。

04:46.545 --> 04:49.682
- YOU CAN BELIEVE IN
WHATEVER GARBAGE YOU WANT TO,
- 你可以相信
无论你想要什么垃圾，

04:49.682 --> 04:52.084
JUST DO IT AWAY FROM ME.
远离我吧。

04:52.084 --> 04:54.754
NOW RUN ALONG AND
WASH KRABS'S UNDIES.
现在一起跑
清洗蟹的内裤。

04:54.754 --> 04:56.856
- YOU GOT IT, SQUIDWARD.
- 你明白了，章鱼哥。

04:59.124 --> 05:02.061
ANYTHING TO KEEP
THAT YETI CRAB AT BAY.
任何要保留的东西
海湾里的雪人蟹。

05:04.797 --> 05:07.466
[tumbling]
[翻滚]

05:16.676 --> 05:18.477
- [sniffs, grunts]
- [嗅嗅，咕哝]

05:21.881 --> 05:24.283
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

05:24.283 --> 05:26.151
[roars]
[怒吼]

05:28.087 --> 05:29.454
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

05:34.393 --> 05:36.896
[sniffs, growls]
[嗅嗅，咆哮]

05:41.400 --> 05:43.502
- LET ME OUT OF HERE,
YOU HAIRY BRUTE.
- 让我离开这里
你这个毛茸茸的畜生。

05:43.502 --> 05:46.105
I CAN FIND MY OWN FOOD.
我可以找到自己的食物。

05:46.105 --> 05:48.708
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

05:48.708 --> 05:50.375
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

05:50.375 --> 05:52.244
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:53.979 --> 05:55.715
- GOOD DAY, SIR.
ARE YOU YETI TO ORDER?
- 美好的一天，先生。
您要订购吗？

05:55.715 --> 05:56.949
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

05:56.949 --> 05:58.483
OH, SQUIDWARD!
哦，章鱼哥！

05:58.483 --> 06:00.019
- WHAT, WHAT, WHAT?
HUH?
- 什么，什么，什么？
嗯？

06:00.019 --> 06:01.586
- YOU ARE NOT
GONNA BELIEVE THIS.
- 你不是
我会相信这一点。

06:01.586 --> 06:03.288
THERE'S A YETI CRAB
AT TABLE SEVEN,
有一只雪人蟹
在七号桌，

06:03.288 --> 06:05.590
AND HE IS SNIFFING OUT
THE LAZY.
他正在嗅出
懒惰。

06:05.590 --> 06:07.326
- [chuckles]
OF COURSE HE IS.
- [轻笑]
他当然是。

06:07.326 --> 06:09.061
NICE COSTUME, EUGENE.
漂亮的服装，尤金。

06:09.061 --> 06:11.797
COULDN'T YOU AT LEAST
HAD IT DRY-CLEANED OR PRESSED?
至少你不能
是否干洗或熨烫过？

06:11.797 --> 06:14.834
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

06:14.834 --> 06:16.902
- DIDN'T BRUSH THIS MORNING,
DID WE?
- 今天早上没刷牙，
我们有吗？

06:16.902 --> 06:18.070
- PLEASE DON'T EAT US,
MR. YETI.
- 请不要吃我们，
先生。雪人。

06:18.070 --> 06:19.171
WE'RE NOT LAZY.
我们并不懒惰。

06:19.171 --> 06:21.741
- OH, YES, I AM.
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，是的，我是。
- 哦，男孩。

06:21.741 --> 06:23.008
I'LL HAVE TO WORK
TWICE AS HARD
我得工作
加倍努力

06:23.008 --> 06:24.810
TO MAKE UP FOR
SQUIDWARD'S LAZINESS.
弥补
章鱼哥的懒惰。

06:28.013 --> 06:29.614
[chuckles nervously]
[紧张地笑]

06:29.614 --> 06:30.950
A WOBBLY TABLE?
摇摇晃晃的桌子？

06:30.950 --> 06:33.753
OH, WE CAN'T HAVE THAT.
哦，我们不能这样。

06:36.756 --> 06:38.390
[grunts]
COME ON.
[咕哝]
来吧。

06:38.390 --> 06:40.059
NO. HERE.
不。这里。

06:40.059 --> 06:41.861
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

06:41.861 --> 06:45.064
- THERE, PERFECT.
- 就这样，完美。

06:45.064 --> 06:46.065
YIKES!
哎呀！

06:46.065 --> 06:47.833
TIME TO TOP OFF THE MUSTARD.
是时候把芥末加满了。

06:51.603 --> 06:53.773
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:53.773 --> 06:54.907
SEE, I'M BUSY.
看，我很忙。

06:54.907 --> 06:56.275
I'M ORGANIZING
THE SPICE RACKS...
我正在组织
调料架...

06:56.275 --> 06:57.810
BY COLOR.
- [grunting]
按颜色。
- [咕哝]

06:57.810 --> 07:01.480
- OOH.
-哦。

07:01.480 --> 07:03.482
- [sneezes]
- [打喷嚏]

07:05.650 --> 07:06.986
- I GUESS
WHILE I'M DOWN HERE,
- 我猜
当我在这儿的时候，

07:06.986 --> 07:09.121
I'LL HIT THE OL'
GREASE TRAPS AGAIN.
我会击中OL'
再次出现油脂陷阱。

07:09.121 --> 07:10.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:16.896 --> 07:19.464
AHH.
啊啊。

07:21.700 --> 07:23.335
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

07:23.335 --> 07:26.371
- AAH! I'M NOT LAZY.
DON'T EAT ME.
- 啊啊！我不懒。
别吃我。

07:26.371 --> 07:28.808
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

07:28.808 --> 07:31.076
- I'M SORRY, MR. YETI CRAB.
- 对不起，先生。雪人蟹。

07:31.076 --> 07:32.444
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

07:32.444 --> 07:35.380
I ALMOST FEEL SORRY
FOR THE LITTLE NIMROD.
我几乎感到抱歉
为了小尼姆罗德。

07:36.982 --> 07:39.084
WHAT THE--
DO YOU MIND?
什么——
你介意吗？

07:39.084 --> 07:41.553
- SORRY, SQUIDWARD,
JUST VARNISHING THE CEILING.
- 对不起，章鱼哥，
只是给天花板上漆。

07:41.553 --> 07:44.023
- OH, I HOPE YOU'RE HAPPY,
MR. KRABS.
- 哦，我希望你快乐，
先生。螃蟹。

07:44.023 --> 07:45.457
YOU'RE DRIVING HIM INSANE.
你快把他逼疯了。

07:45.457 --> 07:46.826
- [growls]
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.
- [咆哮]
- 是啊，是啊，是啊。

07:46.826 --> 07:48.360
YOU'LL EAT ME IF I'M LAZY,
WHATEVER.
如果我懒你就会吃了我，
无论如何。

07:48.360 --> 07:50.595
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

07:50.595 --> 07:53.565
[welding sparks]
[焊接火花]

07:53.565 --> 07:56.668
- NOT THE HOME AND GARDEN
SECTION!
- 不是家庭和花园
部分！

07:56.668 --> 07:58.203
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

07:58.203 --> 07:59.671
- HUH?
OH, SORRY.
- 嗯？
哦，抱歉。

07:59.671 --> 08:01.841
JUST MAKING SURE ALL THE RIVETS
ARE SECURELY WELDED.
只需确保所有铆钉都已固定
已牢固焊接。

08:01.841 --> 08:04.877
- SPONGEBOB,
WE HAVE NO CUSTOMERS TODAY.
- 海绵宝宝，
我们今天没有顾客。

08:04.877 --> 08:07.046
ERGO, WE HAVE NOTHING TO DO,
因此，我们无事可做，

08:07.046 --> 08:09.014
NO MATTER WHAT THAT BUFFOON
WANTS YOU TO THINK.
不管那个小丑是什么
希望您思考。

08:09.014 --> 08:10.816
- [shushes]
SQUIDWARD, HE MIGHT HEAR YOU.
- [嘘]
章鱼哥，他可能会听到你的声音。

08:10.816 --> 08:12.117
DON'T WORRY, MR. YETI CRAB.
别担心，先生。雪人蟹。

08:12.117 --> 08:14.219
WE HAVE PLENTY TO DO.
我们还有很多事要做。

08:14.219 --> 08:15.988
I CAN REPLENISH
THE TOILET PAPER.
我可以补充
卫生纸。

08:15.988 --> 08:17.789
AND REDECORATE
MR. KRABS'S OFFICE.
并重新装修
先生。蟹蟹的办公室。

08:17.789 --> 08:20.359
AND REFOLD THE NAPKINS
INTO ORIGAMI FIGURES.
并重新折叠餐巾
走进折纸人物。

08:20.359 --> 08:21.927
KNIT STRAW COZIES.
针织草垫。

08:21.927 --> 08:23.795
CLEAN THE SOAP.
REPLANE THE GRILL.
清洁肥皂。
重新规划烤架。

08:23.795 --> 08:26.899
WASHING INSIDE THE WALLS.
在墙内清洗。

08:26.899 --> 08:29.268
SUCKING UP EVERY DUST PARTICLE
IN THE RESTAURANT.
吸走每一个灰尘颗粒
在餐厅里。

08:29.268 --> 08:32.037
[vacuum whirring]
[真空呼呼]

08:32.037 --> 08:34.139
- HAVE YOU LOST IT, SPONGEBOB?
- 海绵宝宝，你丢了吗？

08:34.139 --> 08:35.240
- LOST IT?
- 丢失了？

08:35.240 --> 08:36.675
[laughs nervously]
[紧张地笑]

08:36.675 --> 08:39.778
LOST IT?
WHAT A SILLY THING TO SAY.
丢失了？
这是多么愚蠢的事情啊。

08:40.980 --> 08:42.781
AAH!
啊啊！

08:42.781 --> 08:44.049
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

08:44.049 --> 08:47.586
GUESS I'M DOWN
TO THE COMICS SECTION.
我猜我很沮丧
前往漫画部分。

08:47.586 --> 08:50.055
- SQUIDWARD!
- 章鱼哥！

08:50.055 --> 08:51.156
YOU WERE RIGHT.
你是对的。

08:51.156 --> 08:52.958
THERE'S NO MORE WORK TO DO.
没有更多的工作要做。

08:52.958 --> 08:56.061
I HAVE DONE IT ALL...
我已经完成了这一切...

08:56.061 --> 08:57.897
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

08:57.897 --> 09:01.600
- WHICH MEANS
HE IS GONNA EAT US!
- 这意味着
他要吃掉我们！

09:01.600 --> 09:03.936
- THAT DOES IT.
- 就是这样。

09:03.936 --> 09:07.106
I HAVE HAD IT
WITH THIS RIDICULOUS RUSE.
我已经受够了
用这种荒谬的诡计。

09:10.242 --> 09:14.813
USING FEAR TO PREY
ON A FEEBLE MIND.
利用恐惧来捕食
头脑软弱。

09:14.813 --> 09:19.318
EVEN SPONGEBOB
DOESN'T DESERVE THAT.
甚至海绵宝宝
不值得。

09:19.318 --> 09:22.054
ENJOY SPOOKING THE WITLESS,
EH, KRABS?
享受吓唬无知者的乐趣，
呃，蟹蟹？

09:22.054 --> 09:25.290
WELL, WE'LL JUST SEE
HOW YOU LIKE IT.
好吧，我们就看看
您如何喜欢它。

09:25.290 --> 09:27.159
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:27.159 --> 09:28.227
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:28.227 --> 09:29.661
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

09:29.661 --> 09:33.365
SEE? I CAN DRESS UP
AS A CONVINCING YETI CRAB TOO.
看？我可以打扮
作为一只令人信服的雪人蟹。

09:33.365 --> 09:36.068
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

09:36.068 --> 09:38.203
- T-T-TWO YETI CRABS?
- 两只雪人蟹？

09:38.203 --> 09:41.406
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

09:41.406 --> 09:42.774
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:42.774 --> 09:45.544
- TAKE OFF THAT PHONY SUIT,
MR. KRABS.
- 脱掉那套假西装，
先生。螃蟹。

09:45.544 --> 09:47.412
YOU'RE NOT FOOLING ANYBODY.
你没有欺骗任何人。

09:47.412 --> 09:49.381
- I'M BACK, FELLERS.
- 我回来了，费勒斯。

09:49.381 --> 09:50.950
- SORRY, MR. KRABS.
I'M A LITTLE BUSY
- 对不起，先生。螃蟹。
我有点忙

09:50.950 --> 09:53.485
TRYING TO PULL OFF
THIS STUPID MASK OF YOURS.
试图摆脱困境
你这个愚蠢的面具。

09:53.485 --> 09:54.586
- UH, SQUIDWARD?
- 呃，章鱼哥？

09:54.586 --> 09:56.421
- WHAT? OH.
- 什么？哦。

09:56.421 --> 09:59.491
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:03.362 --> 10:05.764
- WE'RE AS GOOD
AS YETI FOOD.
- 我们一样好
作为雪人食物。

10:05.764 --> 10:07.332
I BLAME SQUIDWARD.
我责怪章鱼哥。

10:07.332 --> 10:10.769
- GUYS, DO YOU HEAR THAT?
- 伙计们，你们听到了吗？

10:10.769 --> 10:12.404
- YOU MEAN THE SOUND
OF MY OWN FLESH
- 你指的是声音
我自己的肉身

10:12.404 --> 10:14.139
SIZZLING TO A CRISP?
铁板烧脆？

10:14.139 --> 10:17.476
- NO, I'M TALKING ABOUT
THE SOUND OF A HUNGRY CUSTOMER.
- 不，我说的是
饥饿顾客的声音。

10:17.476 --> 10:19.578
HE DOESN'T WANNA EAT US
FOR BEING LAZY.
他不想吃我们
因为懒惰。

10:19.578 --> 10:22.047
HE WANTS TO EAT US
BECAUSE HE'S HUNGRY.
他想吃掉我们
因为他饿了。

10:22.047 --> 10:24.549
FELLAS, LEAVE THIS TO ME.
伙计们，把这个交给我吧。

10:32.424 --> 10:35.427
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

10:35.427 --> 10:36.895
[chuckles]
[笑声]

10:36.895 --> 10:38.230
- WAY TO GO, BOY.
- 太棒了，男孩。

10:38.230 --> 10:39.831
HE LOVES IT.
他喜欢它。

10:39.831 --> 10:41.000
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

10:41.000 --> 10:43.402
AND LOOK,
HE'S A PAYING CUSTOMER.
看，
他是付费客户。

10:43.402 --> 10:46.871
COME BACK AND SEE US ANYTIME,
MR. YETI CRAB.
随时回来看我们，
先生。雪人蟹。

10:46.871 --> 10:49.508
HEY, WHAT ARE YOU TWO DOING
STANDING IDLE?
嘿，你们两个在做什么
闲着？

10:49.508 --> 10:51.376
SQUIDWARD, SCRAPE OUT
THE CROW'S NEST.
章鱼哥，刮掉
鸦巢。

10:51.376 --> 10:53.078
- NO.
- DONE.
- 不。
- 完毕。

10:53.078 --> 10:55.047
- REFINISH ME FLOORS.
- NO.
- 重新装修我的地板。
- 不。

10:55.047 --> 10:56.581
- DONE.
- BUILD ME A NEW SAFE.
- 完毕。
- 给我建一个新保险箱。

10:56.581 --> 10:57.682
- NUH-UH.
- CONSIDER IT DONE.
- 呃呃。
- 认为它已经完成了。

- 呃呃。
- 认为它已经完成了。